  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="Process a single transaction: upload file to Eneo, start classification, poll for result, parse output.&#xA;&#xA;High-confidence files are moved into a Department sub-folder under &lt;cwd&gt;/&lt;OutputFolder&gt;/&lt;Department&gt;/ (or &lt;cwd&gt;/&lt;OutputFolder&gt;/&lt;FallbackFolder&gt;/ if Department is empty), renamed to SuggestedFilename. Low-confidence files are moved to &lt;cwd&gt;/&lt;OutputFolder&gt;/&lt;ManualReviewFolder&gt;/ — queue item is still marked Failed (Business Rule Exception) and not retried.&#xA;&#xA;Every outcome (OK / ManualReview / Error) is appended to a daily CSV log next to the input files, with the document's classification confidence score.&#xA;&#xA;Filenames are pseudonymised in UiPath/Orchestrator logs as a SHA1-prefix (FilePathHash, &quot;file:xxxxxxxx&quot;); full filenames remain in the local CSV log only. Cross-reference UiPath log lines with CSV rows via FilePathHash.&#xA;&#xA;Throws BusinessRuleException on low confidence, SystemException on API errors or timeout." DisplayName="Process Transaction" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="967,12952" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_Main">
